    "title": "Index Funds vs. ETFs: A Practical Comparison Guide",
    "question": "Index funds vs ETFs — which should I actually pick?",
    "summary": "Index funds and ETFs both track market indexes and offer low-cost, diversified investing, but differ in trading mechanics, tax efficiency, and minimum investment requirements. The best choice depends on your account type, investment style, and financial goals.",
